sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant B as Broker
  participant K as Keycloak
  participant X as xrdp
  participant S as sesman
  participant E as sesexec
  participant V as Validator/replay
  participant N as NSS/SSSD
  participant P as PAM
  B->>K: Authenticate user (OIDC)
  K-->>B: Identity + auth context
  B-->>C: Signed target-bound BAF assertion
  C->>X: RDP TLS + assertion
  X->>S: SCP broker login
  S->>E: EICP broker login
  E->>V: Validate and reserve JTI
  V-->>E: Opaque validated capability
  E->>N: Forward and reverse identity lookup
  N-->>E: UID + canonical username
  E->>P: pam_start + pam_acct_mgmt
  P-->>E: Account accepted
  E->>P: pam_setcred + pam_open_session
  E->>E: Existing session_start
  E-->>C: Desktop session
